Bestow Ancient Curse.MOD	DESC:You bestow a curse that persists through generations.
Bestow Divine Curse.MOD	DESC:-6 to an ability score; -4 on attack rolls, saves, and checks; or 50%% chance of losing each action.
Borrowed Time.MOD	DESC:Animate yourself as one of the undead to complete a specific task.
