Feign Undeath.MOD	DESC:You may deal your target with the physical aspects of a zombie.
Soul Anchor.MOD	DESC:Bars extradimensional movement.
Tomb Ward.MOD	DESC:Invoke a curse to protect a tomb from defilers.
Zone of Deception.MOD	DESC:Subjects within range cannot tell the truth.
Final Rest.MOD	DESC:It can resist to any attermpt to transformation into an undead creature (including Animate Dead and Create Undead spells and create spawn ability of undead creatures).
